[
  {
    "start": 1,
    "end": 3.94,
    "text": "Every great story begins with a seed."
  },
  {
    "start": 6.38,
    "end": 9.95,
    "text": "In Tlaxcala, artisan hands plant and care for the corn."
  },
  {
    "start": 10.88,
    "end": 15.05,
    "text": "IZAMAIZ connects these roots with a new way to care for yourself."
  },
  {
    "start": 18.1,
    "end": 21.05,
    "text": "Pink corn kernels are slowly ground"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.05,
    "end": 23.95,
    "text": "until they become a fine powder."
  },
  {
    "start": 26.48,
    "end": 28.1,
    "text": "The corn continues its journey."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.1,
    "end": 34.05,
    "text": "It is added to the mixture that will become your soap."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.48,
    "end": 35.9,
    "text": "The mixture is whisked,"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.05,
    "end": 39.55,
    "text": "poured into molds,"
  },
  {
    "start": 41.05,
    "end": 42.6,
    "text": "and refrigerated."
  },
  {
    "start": 43.3,
    "end": 46.75,
    "text": "Then, each piece reveals its corn-cob shape."
  },
  {
    "start": 47.4,
    "end": 49.95,
    "text": "The journey of corn ends in your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.95,
    "end": 52.25,
    "text": "Your ritual begins here."
  },
  {
    "start": 52.94,
    "end": 54.74,
    "text": "From our land to your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 54.82,
    "end": 55.85,
    "text": "IZAMAIZ."
  }
]